エージェントに失敗を説明させたり、コマンドを生成させたり、複数ステップのタスクに取り組ませたりできます。その間、shell はブロックされません。","locale":"ja-JP","publisher":"Microsoft","tags":[]},"ko-KR":{"description":"지능형 터미널은 Windows 터미널에서 포크된 네이티브 에이전트 통합을 갖춘 실험 터미널입니다.","locale":"ko-KR","publisher":"Microsoft","tags":[]},"pt-BR":{"description":"Terminal Inteligente é um terminal experimental com integração nativa de agentes, derivado do Terminal do Windows.","locale":"pt-BR","publisher":"Microsoft","tags":[]},"ru-RU":{"description":"Интеллектуальный Терминал — это экспериментальный терминал с встроенной интеграцией агентов, разветвленный от Терминал Windows.","locale":"ru-RU","publisher":"Microsoft","tags":[]},"zh-CN":{"description":"智能终端是一个具有原生智能体集成的实验性终端，基于 Windows 终端 进行分支。主要功能包括在专用窗格中的智能体，可以看到您的 shell 上下文，实时捕获错误，并帮助您修复它们而无需复制粘贴。要求它解释失败、生成命令或处理多步任务，同时您的 shell 保持畅通。","locale":"zh-CN","publisher":"Microsoft","tags":[]},"zh-TW":{"description":"智慧終端機是一個具有原生智慧代理整合的實驗性終端機，由 Windows 終端機 分支而來。主要功能包括在專用窗格中的智慧代理，可以看到您的 shell 內容、實時捕捉錯誤，並幫助您修正它們而無需複製貼上。要求它解釋失敗、產生命令或處理多步驟工作，同時您的 shell 保持暢通。","locale":"zh-TW","publisher":"Microsoft","tags":[]}},"publisherUrl":"https://www.microsoft.com","releaseDate":"2026-06-17","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/microsoft/intelligent-terminal/releases/tag/v0.1.1","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/m/Microsoft/IntelligentTerminal/0.1.1681.0/Microsoft.IntelligentTerminal.yaml","sha256":"4b012430760ad1cff851acdaf53d07e8aaad684ce753c52d465efef0ef65646a"},{"path":"manifests/m/Microsoft/IntelligentTerminal/0.1.1681.0/Microsoft.IntelligentTerminal.installer.yaml","sha256":"7b880530f314840c59b8c351bfc6020a403c77d37bccf7b312f98e70b364d94b"},{"path":"manifests/m/Microsoft/IntelligentTerminal/0.1.1681.0/Microsoft.IntelligentTerminal.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"85c0dcc0b22835117e7968a721564cb48b3f6523617064baf5ebd96234918d3e"},{"path":"manifests/m/Microsoft/Int